<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (This research is significant and innovative because it addresses a critical gap in the existing literature by focusing on Uzbekistan, employs advanced methodologies for robust analysis, and considers the unique socio-economic and cultural context of Central Asia. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
